        "slc_f9b64a00adb78f610ab798bea10149463e805bd3f8e029bd6a6a6cd5b9a84ab3"
      ],
      "text": "The server is written in Clojure with a layered layout: handlers.clj receives all JSON-RPC requests, db.clj holds in-memory state, llm_api.clj is the LLM facade, and llm_providers/ holds vendor adapters."
    },
