        "slc_d8775f9eba4657afca665824b4fc9f82d94233577d711b3e4b1c3f7b64a1f8c9"
      ],
      "text": "The documented request flow is: client/editor → stdin JSON-RPC → handlers → features → llm_api → llm_provider, with results streamed back via messenger."
    },
